// The log tag xrt.model-record (docs/reference/logging.md): each read record
// the --x-read-table model reads back, with its address, value and
// relevance; nothing without the tag.
// RUN: sea-vc %S/inb-witness-memory.mlir --lower --seam --x-read-table=objack --log=xrt.model-record:3 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
// RUN: sea-vc %S/inb-witness-memory.mlir --lower --seam --x-read-table=objack 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=OFF
// CHECK: log: xrt.model-record record=0 addr=({{[0-9a-fx]+}}:bv(64)) value=(1:bv(8)) rel=true
// CHECK: result: sat
// CHECK: xrt.model: relevant=1
// OFF-NOT: xrt.model-record
// OFF: result: sat

